            "detailed_description": "Mosaic é um jogo de aventura moderno com foco na narrativa que dura cerca de 2 a 3 horas. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/349270/extras/a507df3b0df2945bd7b780d3c34a2ebe.poster.avif?t=1692101206\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/349270/extras/a507df3b0df2945bd7b780d3c34a2ebe.webm?t=1692101206\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/349270/extras/a507df3b0df2945bd7b780d3c34a2ebe.mp4?t=1692101206\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Vives uma vida monótona com um dia a dia repetitivo numa gelada cidade, cuja expansão imparável a deixou com população a mais. O telemóvel insiste em distrair-te com notificações irrelevantes à medida que atravessas multidões desconhecidas a caminho do teu emprego numa megacorporação, onde te aguarda mais um longo dia de horas extra. A tua vida não tem qualquer nexo até que um certo dia, algo inesperado acontece e tudo muda.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/349270/extras/ee9ed99355baab1d28cb28ceeb372dd7.poster.avif?t=1692101206\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/349270/extras/ee9ed99355baab1d28cb28ceeb372dd7.webm?t=1692101206\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/349270/extras/ee9ed99355baab1d28cb28ceeb372dd7.mp4?t=1692101206\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Mosaic é um jogo de aventura obscuro, atmosférico e surrealista sobre o isolamento urbano e o terror de sermos apenas uma mera peça de um mecanismo gigante e incompreensível.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/349270/extras/9f2e5bfea5243d7b6a3afbe37bc99022.poster.avif?t=1692101206\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/349270/extras/9f2e5bfea5243d7b6a3afbe37bc99022.webm?t=1692101206\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/349270/extras/9f2e5bfea5243d7b6a3afbe37bc99022.mp4?t=1692101206\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Os criadores de Among the Sleep, Krillbite Studios, passam dos horrores da infância à solidão da idade adulta.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/349270/extras/fcc0eb63585fe9ce89c0314bd22ac28c.poster.avif?t=1692101206\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/349270/extras/fcc0eb63585fe9ce89c0314bd22ac28c.webm?t=1692101206\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/349270/extras/fcc0eb63585fe9ce89c0314bd22ac28c.mp4?t=1692101206\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
